EVIDENCE-AXES-REQUIRED
  -- Any domain shard registered here must declare these before it
  -- can be marked activated.

  parse_status            declared per domain shard
  execution_status        declared per domain shard
  invariant_verification  declared per domain shard
  internal_consistency    demonstrated (no contradictions between
                          data and policy blocks)
  external_consistency    demonstrated (no contradiction with
                          SHARED-NEURORIGHTS)

CHANGELOG
  v1  Cross-domain governance layer created.
      Adopted 10 NEURORIGHTS and 4 governance patterns from the
      nanoswarm shard.
      Placed nutrition and nanoswarm as siblings with no data path.
      Registered 14 pending decisions.
      Nutrition shard v2 remains valid; gains cross_domain_layer
      reference only.
      Earlier nutrition shard v1 (from prior attachments) status
      becomes unresolved_legacy for all reclassified fields.

